digiKam 9.2.0 - Release date: 2026-xx-xx

*****************************************************************************************************
NEW FEATURES:

Bundles component versions:

(*): Updated compared to previous digiKam release.

| Bundles       | Qt         | KDE        | (lib)MariaDB | OpenCV   | FFmpeg    | Heif       | ExifTool  | Exiv2      | G'Mic-Qt  | LibRaw       | Llama.cpp | QtAvPlayer   | Build Environment   |
|---------------|------------|------------|--------------|----------|-----------|------------|-----------|------------|-----------|--------------|-----------|--------------|---------------------|
| Windows Qt6   | 6.11.1 (*) | 6.30.0 (*) | 3.4.8 (*)    | 4.12     | 9.0.2 (*) | 1.23.5 (*) | 13.59 (*) | 0.28.9 (*) | 4.0.3 (*) | 20260914 (*) | 0.5.0     |    -         | Windows 11 + VCPKG  |
| AppImage Qt6  | 6.11.2 (*) | 6.28.0 (*) | 10.06.23     | 4.14 (*) | 9.0.1 (*) | 1.23.3 (*) | 13.59 (*) | 0.28.9 (*) | 4.0.3 (*) | 20260914 (*) | 0.4.1     |    -         | XUbuntu 22.04       |
| macOS Intel   | 6.11.2 (*) | 6.28.0 (*) | 10.11.18     | 4.14 (*) | 8.1.2 (*) | 1.23.4 (*) | 13.59 (*) | 0.28.9 (*) | 4.0.3 (*) | 20260914 (*) | 0.4.1     |    -         | Sequoia + Macports  |
| macOS Silicon | 6.11.2 (*) | 6.28.0 (*) | 10.11.18     | 4.14 (*) | 8.1.2 (*) | 1.23.4 (*) | 13.59 (*) | 0.28.9 (*) | 4.0.3 (*) | 20260914 (*) | 0.4.1     |    -         | Tathoe   + Macports |

Icon-View  : Improve filename matching for timelapse/burst grouping items.
Raw Support: Add support of Sony ARW6 CRAW HQ, Sony ILCE-7M5, and Canon R50 V.
Database   : MySql support is dropped in favor of MariaDB. It's highly recommended to migrate from MySql to MariaDB.
Search     : Natural Language Search in the Advanced Search tool, powered by a local LLM (Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct)
             that runs entirely on your computer. Describe what you want in plain language and digiKam builds the corresponding
             structured search. Supports tags, people, albums, ratings, labels, orientation, places, dates, captions, video properties
             (duration, frame rate, bitrate), and file formats. For details, see this report:
             https://community.kde.org/GSoC/2026/StatusReports/SrirupaDatta
Preview    : Add configurable Play/Pause Video shortcut for preview mode.
Bundles    : macOS Intel ported to Qt6.
General    : Remove the Qt5 support.

*****************************************************************************************************

